# ── the record ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
glyph LET = la v. la k. k(v)

# The SHA-256 round constants K[0..63] (FIPS 180-4 4.2.2) as a Scott list
# of 16 quads, built once. An integer literal is str_to_int("..."), so the
# parameter of that name makes each one an environment lookup instead of a
